# 22. FINAL CREATIVE DIRECTION

Do not turn this into a conventional life simulator.

Do not turn it into a traditional city builder.

Do not turn it into a dialogue-only chatbot.

Do not make the player manually control every character.

The distinctive identity of this game is the combination of:

**A minimalist animated 2D world + autonomous AI characters + natural-language creation + emergent social behaviour.**

The player should be able to create almost any imaginable social situation and observe how the inhabitants respond.

One player might create a peaceful village.

Another might create a dystopian society.

Another might create a town where everyone has conflicting ambitions.

Another might introduce a single mysterious character and watch that character transform the entire community.

There should be no single correct way to play.

The most interesting stories should be the ones that emerge unexpectedly.

